ring investigation, it was determined there was no written operational policies regarding parent may enter the operation.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026646572","facility_name":"Peggys Child Care INC."},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1272062-i20220602-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-501-b-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1272062-i20220602","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-1272062","date":"2022-06-02","original_code":"746.501(b)(1)","severity":"medium_low","severity_label":"Medium-low risk","severity_rank":1,"source_category":"Medium Low","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-07-27","finding":"Operational Policies - Inform Parents That They May Visit Center Anytime During Operating Hours: The operation has a written policy that restrict parent access to the childcare center requiring pre-approval.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026572483","facility_name":"Kiddie Academy of Northpointe"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1180100-i20220518-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-501-b-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1180100-i20220518","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-1180100","date":"2022-05-18","original_code":"746.501(b)(1)","severity":"medium_low","severity_label":"Medium-low risk","severity_rank":1,"source_category":"Medium Low","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-08-01","finding":"Operational Policies - Inform Parents That They May Visit Center Anytime During Operating Hours: The operational policies state the parents must obtain management approval to enter the classrooms.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026577810","facility_name":"Texas Kids Childcare"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-402468-i20220518-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-501-b-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-402468-i20220518","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-402468","date":"2022-05-18","original_code":"746.501(b)(1)","severity":"medium_low","severity_label":"Medium-low risk","severity_rank":1,"source_category":"Medium Low","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-05-31","finding"