hey can visit the center at anytime  Gang Free Zone","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026265840","facility_name":"Ivy League Preschool"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-228987-i20220125-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-501-b-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-228987-i20220125","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-228987","date":"2022-01-25","original_code":"746.501(b)(1)","severity":"medium_low","severity_label":"Medium-low risk","severity_rank":1,"source_category":"Medium Low","status":"corrected","status_label":"Corrected at inspection","finding":"Operational Policies - Inform Parents That They May Visit Center Anytime During Operating Hours: During the investigation inspection it was reviewed in the operational policies that the operation was stating that parent visitors were not allowed at this time due to COVID.  This was corrected at inspection when the policies were updated while I was present.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026345666","facility_name":"Creative Child Learning Academy"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-409268-i20211210-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-501-b-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-409268-i20211210","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-409268","date":"2021-12-10","original_code":"746.501(b)(1)","severity":"medium_low","severity_label":"Medium-low risk","severity_rank":1,"source_category":"Medium Low","status":"corrected","status_label":"Corrected at inspection","finding":"Operational Policies - Inform Parents That They May Visit Center Anytime During Operating Hours: This rule was evaluated with regard to an investigation and has been found to be in violation. The director understands that parents can visit the child-care center any time during the child-care center's hours of operation without having to secure prior approval.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026640300","facility_name":"North Richland Hills Montessori"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1159349-i20211208-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-501-b-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1159349-i20211208","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-1159349