 Anytime During Operating Hours: The operational policies did not inform the parents they are able to visit the center without prior approval.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026242416","facility_name":"Little People's Learning Tree"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1342321-i20211025-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-501-b-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1342321-i20211025","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-1342321","date":"2021-10-25","original_code":"746.501(b)(1)","severity":"medium_low","severity_label":"Medium-low risk","severity_rank":1,"source_category":"Medium Low","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2021-12-02","finding":"Operational Policies - Inform Parents That They May Visit Center Anytime During Operating Hours: Based on the information obtained from the investigation, parents were not informed nor allowed to come inside the daycare center after the Emergency Rules were lifted.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026617282","facility_name":"Whiz Kids Playhouse"}]}
